  "description": "Feeling burned out from work, Yoo Eun decides to relieve stress through her one and only hobby: gaming. When the system update window appears floating in thin air in front of her, she suddenly finds herself being transported inside the game! With no means of escaping and desperate to survive in this strange new world, she manages to secure a job as a tailor at the boutique at 97 Sheldon Street, where she catches the attention of the mysterious noble Ashton Richmond. He says he will help her, but it’s almost as if he’s been waiting for her to show up the whole time… \n\n(Source: Lezhin US, edited)",
